<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 ATI Arum</book>
  <para style="h">1 Atimoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Atimoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Atimoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 A teh</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS ATA JIJI A NA NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ATIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Atimoti a bu kafa kyangwri tufa Nnoh ata nza anyi Asiya.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Ablusu. Mya meh bu kyangwri sa tohmoh nana Kristi Yeso, nza a bu na kira Nnoh ata nza nati a sa reh a hwana, tasa Kristi Yeso ata mbohroh nza meh gya agohsoh na a ŋoh.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Meh ŋa ba nnoh Atimoti, nnoh amehreh amya ata a zizi nimeh nga agohsoh:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Lisa alindeh, kwini tasa tuma alindeh anyi na Nnoh ata nza bu Ada tasa Kristi Yeso Ada ambohroh.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Akpi Ashotoh Ma Ikpi Tsana Ata Huru Tsifa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Tswanza meh ti kǝ kwere nnoh la, hehreh tuma ma akpo afya Afisa shidi fya meh ti kǝ bu ma aki na amya mgba inzi Makidoniya reh, la ti kpi ashotoh ma kyangwri amboh anyi la mata a de tsana anyi tse ata huru tsifa a ba za kpeh, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />ti bleh mboh za la mata a kama a gya kohnoh amoh mboh a na na kakranda amboh agugu kpeh tasa tufa isa Ada mboh ata trina nza a yama kpeh. biroh ika wohroh ka a de hwa aniye ma tsene a ba, ta a leke ta a de ndohmoh Nnoh reh nimeh kira gaga. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Meh kira meh ti tsana kyangwri mboh la anyi ma ta a kira na atohngoh. Lisa dehreh, a zohhoh kyangwri mata a bu na agohsoh zanana, tasa kohnoh ata nza a tsana reh la meh bu na kpakpana kpeh, tasa nga agohsoh ata a zizi ŋoh. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a gyuruna a leke mata a tufa aki ata wohroh reh. Maka a gyuru a leh a tufa aki ata a nati a shingi mboh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Kyangwri mboh reh ma a kira mata bu amboh tsana akpi, mboh neh ma a sohroh a wina andromboh ata nza ma a leh atsifa ma ikpi reh kpeh, ha neh awumu ata mboh nza ma a gya agohsoh la mboh ma a wina na ikpi amoh reh.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Mbohroh meh wina la akpi reh a zohhoh nza mbohroh meh te ndohmoh na wohroh ma aki ata nza a zohhoh reh. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Meh wina za la akpi reh ma a gya ma amboh ata nza ma a tufa yehlehleh kpeh reh, ma a gya neh ma amboh ata nza ma a kputu tsifa Nnoh tasa amboh wuwa ikpi, tasa amboh ata agohsoh amoh nza bu ata Nnoh kpeh reh, tasa amboh kpakpana, tasa amboh ata ma a bu na zanana kpeh, tasa amboh a kya Nnoh, tasa amboh mla alehmeh amoh mboh tasa kekre amoh mboh, tasa amboh mla kyangwri mboh kwo, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />tasa amboh leh ahohndoh ma aki ata nza a zohhoh kpeh, tasa tsifa mboh amboh leh na tsifa mboh, ha ifiya mboh amboh leh na ifiya mboh, tasa amboh te ayuhu kyangwri mboh na wuwana, tasa amboh agugu, tasa amboh bleh huru tsifa ma ikpi akyo mboh, tasa amboh lisa awumu ata nza bu tse na tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi reh, <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />tsana ata a zizi reh a bu tsifa nana ata nza anyi na Nnoh agba ambohroh ata atoh, tsifa ata nza ma nga meh la meh ti hwra bleh ma kyangwri mboh reh.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A kwende Kristi Yeso Tsifa Lisa Alindeh A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Meh kwende Kristi Yeso nza bu Ada ambohroh, ata nza nga meh wuwana la meh ti te ndohmoh ata areh. A kira na amya feh nza a fi meh la meh ti te ndohmoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Mya na kpikpi reh neh meh tini kǝ bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi Nnoh, meh ti nga iya ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh za, tasa za meh ti fi akpi, a tsana meh kwini tsifa la meh tini leh lisa awumu mboh reh ma iyo shini tasa za la meh tini bu na nga agohsoh na Kristi Yeso kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Ada Nnoh ambohroh a lisa meh alindeh gaga tasa za nga meh nga agohsoh tasa kira ata mbohroh nza meh bu na wohroh na Kristi Yeso. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Ata reh a bu tsifa ata a zizi, tasa za a tswa mata a sa tsifa reh nambri la: Kristi Yeso a ba ma inziyo areh ta a ba ba a sa amboh kpakpana mboh a hwana, nimeh amoh nambri kpakpana amya a bu gaga a keh amoh. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ma ikpi tsifa wohroh neh Nnoh a nza kwini amya, mya ata meh nza ni bu kyangwri kpakpana gaga reh, Yeso Kristi reh a tsana soh ivoh ma yira a ŋoh gaga la meh ti tsana aki ma amboh ata ma a nati nga a kira na a ŋoh reh, mata a hunji fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Agohmoh ata nehnehreh, ata ka a kwo kpeh, ata maka a nza ŋoh kpeh, tasa za a bu ŋoh tsene nza bu Nnoh reh. Ta agba tasa nga agba ma bu dehreh a gu a nati tuma atono. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Nnoh Timoti reh, amehreh amya reh, nehnehreh meh buti bleh noh la tufa Nnoh reh yehlehleh. Ti kohnoh za na tsifa ata amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata tama ka a bleh a gya ma ikpi anzoh ameh ata ti kǝ bu ahwra Nnoh reh. Tsifa amboh wohroh a nati a shingi nnoh ti shi wuwana nnoh tswanza amboh de ita shira mboh nza maka a mlana alindeh reh, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />ni bu na kira gaga tasa kohnoh alindeh ata nza ka a tsana la ni bu na kpakpana kpeh. Mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a wina la nga agohsoh amoh reh a zanana za kpeh kǝ te abibi ma ikpi la ma a leke mata a lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh, nza a bu dehreh ma a za a nati a za a kira na tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi reh za kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Nimeh amoh Himeniyu tasa Alekzanda ma a yama, amboh wohroh mya nza ni fira mboh nga agugu ta a de mboh ni wina a ŋoh, la mata a tsana mboh tama ata bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi Nnoh reh.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tsana Ma Ikpi Krumusu Nnoh Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Jiji ŋoh, meh bleh noh la, kwere nnoh Nnoh ma ikpi kyangwri mboh nambri, tasa za la ta a nga mboh awumu ata nza meh a bu na wohroh kpeh reh, ti kwere nnoh Nnoh za ta a shingi mboh. Ti kwende Nnoh ma Nnoh za ma ikpi awumu ata ŋoh nza a lisa mboh nambri reh, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />ma aki wohroh za ti kwere nnoh Nnoh ma Agohgohmoh mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu ma ikpi kpra mboh, la meh ti tuma alindeh, agohsoh ambohroh ta bu fyafya, tuma ambohroh ta bu biroh ika ata agohsoh Nnoh ŋoh, tasa za tuma ambohroh ta a bu ata meh nati nga Nnoh agba tasa mgbiri kyangwri. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Ata areh a bu andromboh alindeh timi kwere Nnoh reh dehreh, Nnoh reh a nati a nza nana ambohroh. A bu ŋoh nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />a bu ŋoh ata nza a kira la kyangwri mboh mata a hunji nvara reh, tasa za mata a hunji tsifa ata a zizi. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Nnoh reh a bu ŋoh anyimbehreh ma, tasa za a bu kyangwri anyimbehreh ata nza a nati a de Nnoh tasa kyangwri mboh a ba ma akpo anyimbehreh, kyangwri reh a bu Kristi Yeso, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />ata nza a gu ikpi a ŋoh a fanga vari kyangwri mboh nambri. Ata areh tama a nza kwo a ŋoh na ameh ŋoh ta ka a su reh. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />A bu ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh Nnoh ka a seh meh la meh ti bu kyangwri hwra tsifa a ŋoh bleh, tasa kyangwri bleh tsifa nana a ŋoh. Tsifa ata mya nza ni leh bleh reh a bu ata a zizi, a sohroh a bu ata huru tsifa kpeh, tasa za mya meh bu kyangwri tsana tohmoh a ŋoh ata a zizi ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Nza ka a bu dehreh meh kira kyangwri mata a leh a kwere Nnoh ma atsi dohsohna amoh mboh reh, mata a leh a fira ivoh zanana amoh mboh reh a ka ma inza mata a kama a te gofo ha neh mata a fi akpi kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Mya meh kira ifiya mboh za mata a jimi tasa mata a were kuri ikata nza a zohhoh, a bu jimi shina ikpi kpeh ha kpakpa hungroh tasa kuri ata hungroh a ŋoh nza bu gaga reh kpeh, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />a bu amboh ata neh nza ma a bu na agohsoh alilehndeh, ata nza a zohhoh na ifiya mboh amboh ata nza ma a tsana la mboh ma bu amboh tufa Nnoh.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Afya ta bu gbalala ma aki kpehkpehteh tasa za ta a bu na kuku ikpi. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Meh nga aki ma afya ta a tsana tsifa mboh kpeh, ha ta a de kpra Agohmoh ma ikpi tsifa mboh kpeh, ŋoh ta bu gbalala ma. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Meh bleh tsifa reh la, Nnoh tana a jiji a lisa Adamu a treh fiya sa a lisa Hawawu. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Ma a sohroh a landa Adamu kpeh, ma a gyuru a landa afya a ŋoh, ŋoh neh ka a kpakpana. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />ifiya mboh neh ma a nati a hunji nvara ma aki mara amehreh, nza ma a leh a hehndeh nimeh nga agohsoh tasa kira tasa zanana, tasa kuku kpi.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">amboh Ata Nza ma A zohhoh Mata A bu Agbugba Nimeh Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Tsifa ata areh a bu yehlehleh la, akyo ata nza a kira ta bu agba ata de kyangwri Nnoh mboh, a bu ndohmoh alindeh a kira ta a lisa. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Nehnehreh, akyo ata nza bu agba nimeh ida Nnoh, a zohhoh ta a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh, ta a bu na afiya anyimbehreh, ta a bu na agohsoh alindeh, ta a bu na kuku ikpi, ta a de ikpi a ŋoh alindeh, ta bu kyangwri sa sene mboh, ta a bu kyangwri wina tsana, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />ta a bu kyangwri te fiya kpeh, ta bu kyangwri fa akpi kpeh, ta a bu na kuku ikpi, ta bu kyangwri yaha aniye kpeh, tasa za ta bu kyangwri kira hungroh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Ta bu kyangwri ata nza a wina a de mara a ŋoh mboh alindeh kanga, mara a ŋoh mboh za mata a sehreh tsifa a ŋoh, tasa za mata bu amboh nga ŋoh agba. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Nza akyo ata nza a wina a de afiya a ŋoh kpeh, a ka a nati a lisa lele feh sa ka a wina a de kyangwri Nnoh umbo? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Ta a sohroh a bu kyangwri ata nza a treh a sa Nnoh afeh kpeh, la gu ikpi a ka a nati a de ŋoh mata ahwra ŋoh akpi ikata agugu reh. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />A zohhoh akyo ata nza a nati a de kyangwri mboh ma ida Nnoh, ta bu akyo ata nza ma atsifa alindeh ma ikpi a ŋoh ma tohmoh kyangwri amboh ata ma bu amboh tufa mboh kpeh, la ta a kama a gu isa ta a hwa nimeh rishi agugu reh kpeh.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Ma aki wohroh za, amboh te ndohmoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh, a zohhoh mata bu amboh agohsoh alilehndeh kanga, mata bu amboh bleh zizi, tasa za mata kama bu amboh wa amwo inabi reh kpeh ha amboh kira mata a rifa awumu hunji firoh gaga kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Mata a kira na tsifa ata nza bu a zizi reh kanga, tasa kohnoh ata nza a tsana la ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Mata a jiji a tsara mboh a nza a treh feh kanga, mata a nza nza ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh, feh masa ka a te ndohmoh ma ida Nnoh reh. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Ma aki wohroh za, ifiya amoh mboh za mata bu ifiya amboh agohsoh alilehndeh, mata a sohroh bu amboh hende tsifa ma ikpi kyangwri mboh kpeh, mboh neh mata bu amboh kuku ikpi tasa amboh tsana zizi ma akeki mboh reh nambri <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />A zohhoh kyangwri te ndohmoh ma ida Nnoh ta bu atsifa afya anyimbehreh, tasa za ta bu kyangwri wina fyoh mara a ŋoh mboh tasa afiya a ŋoh alindeh. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />amboh ata nza ma a te ndohmoh alindeh nimeh kyangwri amboh tufa mboh reh, maka a hunji isa alindeh, tasa kira gaga ata nza a bu nimeh nga agohsoh nimeh sa Kristi Yeso. <verse eid="1TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Meh gya agohsoh meh ti ba na anzoh, a nati a yanda kpeh, meh ŋa tsifa mboh reh ba nnoh la, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />nza meh yanda reh neh, ni nati wina biroh tuma ata nza a zohhoh mata a tuma na kyangwri Nnoh mboh reh, ata nza bu ida Nnoh ata fene, wohroh nza bu ingri tasa chuhu a zizi tsifa reh. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />A bu dehreh la, tsifa ata Nnoh nza tsana reh ma ikpi Kristi Yeso reh a bu agba. Akyo a nati a wina kpa aniye ma ikpi tsifa ata areh kpeh. Mbohroh nambri meh kira tsifa ata areh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">A ba na ambohroh tswanza kyangwri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Huru reh a tsana la ŋoh reh a bu zizi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh za tama a nza ŋoh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Kyangwri ma ahwra tsifa a ŋoh a bleh a treh atsifi ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh ma inziyo reh nambri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ma a kira na a ŋoh ma inziyo a treh atsifi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Ma a gu ŋoh a na ma inza la mata a bu mboh ma a ŋoh.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Akpi Ashotoh Ma Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Huru Nnoh reh a tsana reh fyafya la, a nati a ba ma trina ŋoh, mgbiri kyangwri ma a nati a za a kira na tsifa a zizi ata Kristi Yeso reh za kpeh, ma a nati a gyuru a tufa huru agugu, tasa awumu ata amboh amwo mboh nza ma a tsana reh. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Tsana amboh ata areh a nati anyi na amboh agugu mboh, kohnoh agohsoh amoh a nati a kwo tswanza ma afya na shira karafi reh. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Kyangwri amboh wohroh ma a nati a ha kyangwri mboh sa afya tasa za mata a gyuru a ha mboh rya mgbiri awumu rya mboh za. Nnoh neh a lisa irya mboh reh la kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a kira reh tasa amboh ata nza ma a kira reh mata sa na kwende. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Awumu ata Nnoh nza a lisa mboh nambri reh ma a zohhoh, mbohroh meh ti kama leke andromboh anyi kpeh, nza mbohroh meh sa meh ti kwende reh, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />nza ma a lisa ta bu fyafya ma aki tsifa Nnoh tasa na kwere Nnoh.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahwra Kristi Yeso Alindeh ŊOH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Nza ni tsana tsifa Nnoh ma amohnoh mboh amboh tufa mboh reh, ni nati bu ahwra alindeh ata Kristi Yeso a ŋoh, ata nza a te agba nimeh tsifa nga agohsoh tasa tsana alindeh ata nza ni leh tufa reh a gu a ba ba a te nehnehreh. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Nnoh neh ti leke kakranda ata huru tsifa tasa ata nza a zohhoh kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh, nnoh za ti de ikpi anzoh alindeh ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />A zohhoh kyangwri ta a kpato a zuzu itoh a ŋoh, la itoh a ŋoh ta a hunji wuwana, tasa za neh a zohhoh ti bu na agohsoh ika ata Nnoh nza a kira ti bu na wohroh reh, ata areh a nati a shingi kyangwri ta a hunji te atoh ma inziyo ata nehnehreh tasa nza ni kwo ti gyuru hunji fene za na Nnoh ma inza.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ata areh a bu tsifa a zizi, a zohhoh meh ti sa tsifa reh nambri, <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />ma ikpi tsifa areh, Mbohroh meh shi wuwana meh ti te ndohmoh reh, Mbohroh meh gya agohsoh ambohroh na Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene zizi reh, ata nza a nati a sa kyangwri mboh a hwa na nambri, tasa amboh ata nza ma a kira na a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Bleh tasa za ti tsana mboh awumu amboh areh. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Kama kira la akyo ta a nza noh a rina la ni bu kafa kpeh, nnoh neh ti tsana aki ma mgbiri amboh tufa mboh, nimeh tsifa, tasa nimeh tuma anzoh, tasa kira tasa nga agohsoh tasa za agohsoh ta bu fyafya. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ni nati leh bleh amgbasho reh were ma kyangwri Nnoh mboh reh tre fya meh si ba, ni nati tsana mboh tasa za ti hwra tsifa Nnoh reh were mboh. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Kama ta ngǝnga ata nza ni bu na wohroh reh kpeh, ata nza ma a nga noh ma aki bleh tsifa tohmoh ameh ata agbugba kyangwri amboh ida Nnoh mboh ma ta ka a gya nnoh ivoh amoh mboh a te nnoh atoh reh.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Lisa awumu mboh reh nimeh ndohmoh anzoh mboh, ti nga mboh ikpi anzoh nambri, la mata a nza rya tohmoh anzoh. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Lisa nza ikpi anzoh alindeh tasa tsana anzoh. Shi nata ma atsi te ndohmoh mboh reh, nza ni lisa dehreh ni nati sa ikpi anzoh hwana tasa amboh ata nza ma a sehreh noh reh.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kpi Ashotoh Ma Ikpi ifiya Kunu Mboh, Agbugba Mboh Tasa Ahwra Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Kama hwa achoh kyangwri na gofo kpeh, za kǝ kwere ŋoh tswanza a bu atsiyoh mara anzoh. Kafa mboh za gu mboh tswanza atsi anzoh mboh, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Achohchoh ifiya mboh za tswanza atono mboh, tasa kafa ifiya mboh za tswanza asra anzoh mboh na agohsoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="1TI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Nga agba ma ifiya kunu mboh, amboh nza ma a bu ma a zizi ma bu na akyo ata nza a nati a shingi mboh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Nza afya kunu neh ka bu na amehreh mboh ha yehreh a ŋoh mboh, tama a jiji a tsana agohsoh ika ata Nnoh a na na alohsoh a ŋoh mboh, la nyi ma a huru mboh za ma a nati a gyuru a shingi alehmeh amoh mboh andromboh ata mboh nza ma a hunji anyi na amoh reh. A bu ata areh ŋa nza a nga a nana agohsoh ma Nnoh. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Nehnehreh afya kunu ata a zizi, a bu na akyo ata nza a nati shingi ŋoh kpeh, a ka a gya agohsoh a ŋoh a na ni Nnoh, a ka a kwere Nnoh nashi ni tasa na nnoh a na na a ŋoh la ta a shingi ŋoh. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Afya kunu ata nza la ŋoh a tuma a nza nana ikpi a ŋoh ma reh neh, ŋoh ka a tswanza kǝ kwo neh a treh a bu na fene. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Bleh ma kyangwri tsifa amboh areh za, la akyo ta a hunji aki a kya nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Akyo ata nza a nza kini a ŋoh mboh a wina kpeh, ha ata a zizi chuhu mara a ŋoh mboh, kǝ gyuru nyina ma nga agohsoh a ŋoh reh tasa a keh te abibi a keh amboh nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="1TI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Afya kunu a tswa mata a fi ŋoh nimeh ifiya kunu mboh kpeh, ahushi a ŋoh a nati bu agrumavoh da atehrehkifi feh, ha la tana ka a de ikpi a ŋoh na ameh atsifa ta ka a treh a bu na fene, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />tasa ata nza ma a wina ŋoh na agohsoh alindeh, ata nza a huhwa amehreh mboh gaga, ka a lisa ma sene mboh alindeh, ta a hwara hwana amboh zanana mboh, ta a shingi amboh nza ma a bu nimeh iya, ta a fi ikpi a ŋoh atsi te ndohmoh alindeh ha a bu ika ata ama. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Nza a bu ifiya kunu akǝkehreh mboh reh, kama bleh mboh nnoh nimeh amgbasho reh kpeh, tsifa la nza ma a wina de ikpi amoh a wuwa ma atsi nga agohsoh amoh ma Yeso Kristi kpeh, ma ata mboh mata a sa atsifa ma, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Maka a de hwra akpi a ba ma ikpi amoh, tsifa la, ma a za lisa andromboh ata mata ka a jiji a bleh a gya reh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />A bu wohroh tsene kpeh, ma akpehkpehteh tuma abibi, maka a hehndeh ka aniye afiyafiya kyangwri mboh. bu tuma abibi tsene maka a lisa kpeh, neh maka a hehndeh tsifa ma ikpi itoh amoh mboh za, maka aniye a te andromboh, ata nza a zohhoh mata a lisa dehreh kpeh <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Meh keh kira kafa ifiya mboh amboh ata tsifa amoh mboh nza ma a kwo mata a sa atsifa, mata a mara amehreh mboh, mata a shi a lisa awumu afiya fiya amoh mboh, tsifa la meh ti kama nga aki ma agugu ta a bleh tsifa kputu sa ma ikpi ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />A nga meh nyiri la amboh tswa maka a te atsetse tasa nehnehreh maka a bu ti tufa agugu. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Nza afya ata nza ka tufa Yeso Kristi ata nza a te alohsoh na ifiya kunu mboh, ta a shingi mboh, ma a kama ta rishi agba ma ida Nnoh kpeh, tsifa la ida Nnoh reh ta a hunji a shingi fya kunu mboh amboh nza ma a bu na akyo ta a shingi mboh kpeh <verse eid="1TI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Agbugba mboh amboh ata nza ma a te ndohmoh nimeh ida Nnoh alindeh reh, a zohhoh mata a nga mboh a mangara a te na afri, ta susu a bu amboh hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh tasa amboh tsana mboh. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Tsifa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama hama nnoh aniye ma londo ndohmoh na ameh ata nza a bu ti va yohroh awumu rya kpeh.&gt;&gt; tasa &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a te ndohmoh tama a fanga ŋoh firoh a ŋoh. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Kama kira ti sehreh la kyangwri agba anyi amboh shi ma tohmoh, anyi a lisa andromboh abibi ti shi sa kira kpeh. Sehreh nyi ma aniye kyangwri afri ha atatoh feh nnoh si kira. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />amboh ata nza maka a kpakpana reh, shi ti hwa mboh ma hohroh duma la itswa mata a sehreh mata a nyiri.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ma tohmoh Nnoh, tasa Kristi Yeso, tasa mara tohmoh Nnoh amboh zanana mboh za ma a seh mboh, meh kpi nnoh ashotoh ti tufa nnoh tsifa amboh ata areh, la ti tsana noh kira ikpi kpeh ha ti tsana noh la ni keh kira akyo anyi keh atohngoh kpeh.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Kama bu gbugbo atsi nati seh agba amboh de ida Nnoh kpeh. la ti manda itoh anzoh nimeh kpakpa na na akyo mboh kpeh. Neh ti kehsheh ikpi anzoh na zanana.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Kama wa amwo wusu tsene kpeh, wa amwo mara agbeh inabi reh shidi tsifa rina yira anzoh tasa tsifa leh bishi anzoh huhuri reh.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Kpakpana mgbiri kyangwri amboh itswa ka a bu ma inziyo ma kakende, maka a tsana a kate feh masa ahwra mboh akpi. Kpakpana itswa neh ka a kate anyi ma nyina amoh. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />A bu dehreh za, andromboh alindeh ata kyangwri mboh maka a lisa reh, maka a tsana a kate kakende, ma a nati a mishi a huho mboh kpeh.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />amboh nza ma a bu na rishi ata ahwra ma agba amoh reh, a zohhoh tama a nga agba ma agbugba amoh mboh ma aki alindeh. Mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a nati a wina bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi isa Nnoh kpeh, ha ma ikpi tsifa Mbohroh nza meh tsana reh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Ahwra mboh nza ma a bu na agbugba amoh mboh nza ma a bu amboh tufa mboh ma a kama a rina mboh kpeh tsifa la ma a bu atsi mboh. Dehreh neh tama a lisa a keh nga mboh agba la amboh nza ma a nga agba ma a bu amboh tufa Nnoh mboh<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kira Hungroh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Nza akyo anyi a tsana tsifa anyi tse ata nza a gu a zizi tsifa ata Ada Yeso Kristi tasa tsana ata nza a zohhoh ma aki tufa Nnoh Kpeh, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />kyangwri mboh amboh ika wohroh ma a kohnoh amoh la mboh ma a bu na lomo. Neh ma a sohroh a wina andromboh. maka a bu na agohsoh kira yaha aniye tasa kpa aniye ma ikpi mara tsifa mboh. A bu wohroh ŋa nza ka a de vene, tasa kputuna, tasa kputu sa, tasa kohnoh agugu a ba reh, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />tasa gohroh gaga na amboh ata kohnoh amoh nza a bu abibi, Ma a za bu na zizi kpeh. amboh wohroh maka a kohnoh la tufa Nnoh reh a bu aki nyi ata hunji asabara. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Tufa Nnoh na agohsoh anzoh nambri tasa ti hunji kuku agohsoh, a bu firoh agba ni nati hunji. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Tsifa la timi ba inziyo na andromboh kpeh, meh nati wina gu andromboh kate nyi nimeh kpeh. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Nza neh meh bu na rya tasa akuri ata were, areh tsene kǝ tswa. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Kyangwri mboh amboh nza ma a kira mata a te asabara maka a hwa tsara tasa nimeh arishi tasa nimeh duduna tasa nimeh a huya ata nza a nati ka mboh ikpi ata a nati de mboh te abibi tasa nasana <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Kira hungroh bu chuhu agugu mboh ma atsetse nambri. Kira hungroh gbugbo, mgbiri kyangwri mboh maka a yi aki nga agohsoh amoh reh ata, a ka a de hwashi agohsoh ma atsetse ata rinana a ba mboh.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Akpi Ashotoh Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Nnoh neh Timoti noh ni bu ata Nnoh ŋoh, gbo nyi ma awumu amboh ata areh nambri, fi ikpi atsi fa aki tufa yehlehleh, tasa ti bu na biroh agohsoh ata Nnoh, tasa ni nga agohsoh, tasa kira, tasa wuwa ikpi ahroh, tasa kuku ikpi. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Shi wuwana yivoh nimeh ata gya agohsoh reh. Ti de fene ata tuma atono reh, ata tama ka a fi noh tsifa wohroh reh, nza ni kǝ bleh ajija bleh na aniye anzoh ma tomo kyangwri mboh gaga. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ma tohmoh Nnoh, ata nza ka a nga fene ma awumu mboh nambri, tasa ata Kristi Yeso , ata ta ka a buti bleh ma tohmoh Bontus Bilatus tana a bu ajija bleh na aniye, meh kwere nnoh, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />ti tufa nnoh aki ata areh yehlehleh ikya ha kpakpana ta a kama a yama kpeh, a gu a na na te Ada Yeso Kristi, ta a ba. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Ba Yeso reh, Nnoh a nati lisa ta a bu na ameh yehlehleh. ŋoh tsene ata nza de kpra nambri ata te atoh, Agohmoh ata agohgohmoh mboh, tasa Ada ata ada mboh, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />ŋoh tsene nza ka a kwo kpeh, nza ka a tuma nimeh zana nza maka a na nda kpeh. Ata akyo a mishi a nza ŋoh kpeh, ha la a nati wina nza ŋoh. Na a ŋoh bu ringa tasa agba ta a tuma atono. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Bleh ma amboh nza ma a bu na asabara ma inziyo areh la tama a kama a gu ikpi amoh a ka kpeh ha la mata a gya agohsoh amoh ma ikpi asabara ata awumu inziyo areh nza ma a wina la ha a nati a bu lele kpeh, neh tama a gya agohsoh amoh ni Nnoh ma, ata nza ka a nga reh gaga la meh ti nza nana a ŋoh. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Bleh nnoh ma amboh asabara mboh reh mata a lisa alindeh, asabara amoh ta bu ma aki te ndohmoh alindeh, maka a vuru ivoh ma atsi ngǝnga, tasa mata a bu amboh shingi amboh anyi. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Ma aki dehreh ma a nati a gya ma ikpi amoh asabara ata nza a nati bu chuhu tuma amoh ata nza a nati ba reh, la ta a bu a wuwana nimeh fene ata nza a bu a zizi fene.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Nnoh Timoti, lisa de andromboh ata nza ma a nga noh ma ivoh anzoh reh. Gu ikpi anzoh kate nyi na tsifa abibi amboh ata nza a tsana nyiri Nnoh kpeh reh, tasa ti niye nimeh kpa aniye ata duduna amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh reh, amboh tsifa ma ikpi aki nza ma a gu la a bu wina lomo, neh a bu huru tsifa ma, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />ma aki tufa tsana ika ata wohroh, kyangwri mboh amboh mgbiri maka a gbo a yi aki nga agohsoh amoh reh ata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Lisa alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>